87	
88	    /**
89	     * Email domains belonging to disposable-address providers. An owner whose email domain (the part
90	     * after the '@', compared case-insensitively) is one of these is rejected: such addresses are
91	     * throwaway and unsuitable for a durable owner record.
92	     */
